Package: enigma2-plugin-extensions-abertisautoswitcher
Version: 1.9.17
Architecture: all
Maintainer: AbertisAuto <abertisautoswitcher@example.com>
Depends: enigma2
Section: extras
Priority: optional
Description: Abertis Auto - automatic setup for every Abertis feed
  Generates an astra stream and an OSCam-EMU A-rule for every
  "Abertis PID <n>" feed in lamedb, then handles any Ciefp
  /abertis/pid<n> URL automatically with an F1 learning phase and
  F5 playback phase. 8008 is automated too, even though the feed is
  currently off-air. Every config change is backed up, only missing
  entries are appended, astra restarts are guarded and playback is
  verified from the native decoder information.
